@baseUrl = https://localhost:5006
@token = replace-with-token

### List scoped devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/devices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create non-secret device metadata (no credential values)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"deviceCode":"OUTLET-01","serialNumber":"SERIAL-01","vendorCode":"ConfiguredVendor","model":"ConfiguredModel","operationalLocationProjectionId":10,"protocolType":"ADMS","deviceTimeZoneId":"Asia/Dhaka","connectionHost":"terminal.internal","connectionPort":443,"credentialSecretReference":"outlet-device-secret"}

### Update with explicit credential-reference preservation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/devices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":1,"replaceCredentialReference":false,"data":{"deviceCode":"OUTLET-01","serialNumber":"SERIAL-01","vendorCode":"ConfiguredVendor","model":"ConfiguredModel","operationalLocationProjectionId":10,"protocolType":"ADMS","deviceTimeZoneId":"Asia/Dhaka","status":"Offline"}}

### Deactivate (mapping history is retained)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/devices/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":2}

### List mapping history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/devices/1/mappings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create half-open mapping interval; offset normalized to UTC
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/devices/1/mappings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"employeeId":1,"deviceUserId":"23","effectiveFromUtc":"2027-01-01T00:00:00+06:00"}

### Close without deletion, explicit UTC instant + expected version
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/v1/attendance/device-user-mappings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":1,"effectiveToUtc":"2027-02-01T00:00:00+06:00"}
